{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal multiprofile setup using scvi_n200 RNA and imagenet_vit_l image encoders, achieving validation accuracy of 0.7062 and F1 of 0.6671. These results are slightly lower than the concat fusion baseline (llm_summary_009) with the same configuration, suggesting weighted fusion may not improve performance in this setup. The role of fusion strategies remains uncertain without direct comparison to other methods."
}

